<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <title>家装平台小程序原型 - 合同详情（导航栏合规版）</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="common.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/contract-detail.css">

    <style>
        /* ============================================================
           导航栏合规改造（v2 示范页，样式仅作用于本页面）
           目标：不自绘模仿微信胶囊的 ⋯/✕，原菜单功能全部平移到页内合规位置
           原页面 contract-detail.html / task-report.html 保持原样，未做任何改动
           ============================================================ */

/* 微信原生胶囊占位（样式参考真机效果，由微信客户端实际渲染） */
.nav-bar .native-capsule {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    min-width: 56px;
    height: 28px;
    padding: 0 10px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1;
    user-select: none;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}
.nav-bar .native-capsule .nc-left,
.nav-bar .native-capsule .nc-right {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 16px;
}
.nav-bar .native-capsule .nc-right {
    font-size: 10px;
}
.nav-bar .native-capsule .nc-divider {
    width: 1px;
    height: 14px;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    margin: 0 4px;
}
        .nav-bar .native-capsule .nc-left,
        .nav-bar .native-capsule .nc-right {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 16px;
        }
        .nav-bar .native-capsule .nc-right {
            font-size: 10px;
        }
        .nav-bar .native-capsule .nc-divider {
            width: 1px;
            height: 14px;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            margin: 0 4px;
        }

        /* 页内文字版「更多」按钮 —— 位于内容区，不在导航栏，避开仿冒界面风险 */
        .content-toolbar {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 10px 4px 0;
        }

        .content-toolbar .tb-hint {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--text-tertiary, #C0C4CC);
        }

        .text-more-btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 4px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--primary-color, #1677FF);
            padding: 4px 8px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .text-more-btn:active { background-color: var(--bg-secondary, #F7F8FA); }

        .text-more-btn .caret {
            font-size: 10px;
            transition: transform 0.2s;
        }

        .text-more-btn.open .caret { transform: rotate(180deg); }

        .more-ops-panel {
            display: none;
            margin-top: 8px;
            background-color: var(--bg-primary, #FFFFFF);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color, #E5E6EB);
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .more-ops-panel.show { display: block; }

        .more-ops-panel .op-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            padding: 11px 14px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--text-primary, #1D2129);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color, #F2F3F5);
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .more-ops-panel .op-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

        .more-ops-panel .op-item:active { background-color: var(--bg-secondary, #F7F8FA); }

        .more-ops-panel .op-item .op-icon { font-size: 15px; }

        .more-ops-panel .op-item .op-tag {
            margin-left: auto;
            font-size: 10px;
            color: var(--text-tertiary, #C0C4CC);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color, #E5E6EB);
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 1px 5px;
        }
    </style>

    <style>
        /* 底部操作坞：把「预览合同」提到底部操作栏，与状态操作按钮共存 */
        .bottom-dock {
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            background-color: var(--bg-primary, #FFFFFF);
            box-shadow: 0 -2px 10px var(--shadow-md, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06));
            z-index: 20;
        }

        .bottom-dock .preview-bar { padding: 10px 16px 0; }

        .bottom-dock .preview-btn {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 6px;
            height: 38px;
            border: 1px solid var(--primary-color, #1677FF);
            color: var(--primary-color, #1677FF);
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 14px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .bottom-dock .preview-btn:active { background-color: var(--status-primary-bg, #E8F3FF); }

        /* 动态状态操作栏改为文档流，避免与操作坞重叠（JS 仍按原逻辑控制显隐） */
        .bottom-dock .bottom-actions {
            position: static;
            box-shadow: none;
            padding: 12px 16px;
        }

        .page-content { padding-bottom: 150px; }
    </style>

    <style>
        /* 工人合同（方案 B）邀请名单卡片 */
        .worker-invite-card .worker-contract-meta {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--text-secondary, #4E5969);
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .worker-invite-card .worker-contract-meta .meta-row {
            display: flex;
        }
        .worker-invite-card .worker-contract-meta .meta-label {
            width: 76px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            color: var(--text-tertiary, #86909C);
        }
        .worker-invite-card .worker-contract-meta .meta-value {
            flex: 1;
            color: var(--text-primary, #1D2129);
        }
        .invite-list {
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color, #E5E6EB);
            margin-top: 4px;
        }
        .invite-row {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 11px 2px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color, #F2F3F5);
        }
        .invite-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        .invite-avatar {
            width: 34px;
            height: 34px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-color, #1677FF) 0%, var(--primary-light, #4096FF) 100%);
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 13px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-right: 10px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .invite-row.is-me .invite-avatar {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FA8C16 0%, #FFC069 100%);
        }
        .invite-info { flex: 1; }
        .invite-name { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-primary, #1D2129); }
        .invite-role { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-tertiary, #86909C); margin-top: 2px; }
        .invite-status {
            font-size: 12px;
            padding: 2px 10px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .invite-status.pending { background: #E6F7FF; color: #0050B3; }
        .invite-status.confirmed { background: #E8FFEA; color: #00875A; }
        .invite-status.rejected { background: #FFF1F0; color: #CF1322; }
        .invite-status.taken { background: #F2F3F5; color: #86909C; }
        .arch-note {
            margin-top: 12px;
            padding: 10px 12px;
            background: var(--status-success-bg, #E8FFEA);
            color: var(--success-color, #00875A);
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        /* 工人合同流程条（覆盖默认状态流程） */
        .worker-flow {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            margin-top: 6px;
        }
        .worker-flow .wf-step {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            flex: 1;
        }
        .worker-flow .wf-circle {
            width: 28px;
            height: 28px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--bg-secondary, #F2F3F5);
            color: var(--text-tertiary, #86909C);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .worker-flow .wf-step.current .wf-circle {
            background: var(--primary-color, #1677FF);
            color: #fff;
        }
        .worker-flow .wf-step.done .wf-circle {
            background: var(--success-color, #00875A);
            color: #fff;
        }
        .worker-flow .wf-label { font-size: 11px; margin-top: 4px; color: var(--text-secondary, #4E5969); }
        .worker-flow .wf-line { flex: 1; height: 2px; background: var(--border-color, #E5E6EB); margin: 0 4px 16px; }
        .worker-flow .wf-line.done { background: var(--success-color, #00875A); }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="phone-frame">
        <div class="status-bar">
            <div class="time">9:41</div>
            <div class="icons">📶 🔋</div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="nav-bar">
            <div class="back" onclick="history.back()">← 返回</div>
            <div class="title centered">合同详情</div>
            
        
            <div class="actions"><div class="native-capsule" title="微信原生胶囊：由微信客户端渲染，开发者不可自定义其内容"><span class="nc-left">⋯</span><span class="nc-divider"></span><span class="nc-right">○</span></div></div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="page-content">
                <div class="content-toolbar">
                    <span class="tb-hint">合同辅助操作</span>
                    <span class="text-more-btn" id="moreOpsBtn" onclick="toggleMoreOps()">更多<span class="caret">▾</span></span>
                </div>
                <div class="more-ops-panel" id="moreOpsPanel">
                    <div class="op-item" onclick="showVersionModal(); closeMoreOps();"><span class="op-icon">📋</span><span>版本记录</span></div>
                    <div class="op-item" onclick="showChangeRecordModal(); closeMoreOps();"><span class="op-icon">📜</span><span>变更记录</span></div>
                    <div class="op-item" id="exportContractBtn" style="display: none;" onclick="exportContract(); closeMoreOps();"><span class="op-icon">📄</span><span>导出合同文件</span></div>
                </div>

            <div class="card status-banner draft" id="statusBanner">
                <div class="status-text" id="statusText">拟定中</div>
                <div class="status-desc" id="statusDesc">合同正在编辑中，编辑完成后可提交确认</div>
                <div class="reject-reason-box" id="rejectReasonBox" style="display: none;">
                    <div class="reject-reason-title">⚠️ 驳回原因</div>
                    <div class="reject-reason-content" id="rejectReasonContent"></div>
                    <div class="reject-reason-tip">请根据以上原因修改合同内容后重新提交</div>
                </div>
                <div class="edit-guide-box" id="editGuideBox" style="display: none;">
                    <div class="edit-guide-title">📝 修改引导</div>
                    <div class="edit-guide-content">
                        请按以下步骤修改合同内容：
                        <ol>
                            <li>在电脑浏览器打开平台官网</li>
                            <li>使用手机扫码授权登录</li>
                            <li>进入合同管理，找到此合同</li>
                            <li>根据驳回原因修改对应内容</li>
                            <li>保存后返回小程序重新提交</li>
                        </ol>
                        <div class="edit-guide-btn" onclick="copyEditLink()">
                            <span>📋</span>
                            <span>复制电脑端编辑链接</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="change-reason-display" id="changeReasonDisplay" style="display: none;">
                <div class="reason-title">
                    <span>📝</span>
                    <span>变更原因</span>
                </div>
                <div class="reason-content" id="changeReasonText">
                    因业主需求变更，需要增加部分水电点位。新增卫生间水电点位5个，厨房水电点位3个，阳台水电点位2个。
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="change-summary-card" id="changeSummaryDisplay" style="display: none;">
                <div class="summary-header">
                    <span>📊</span>
                    <span>变更内容摘要</span>
                </div>
                <div class="summary-list" id="changeSummaryList">
                    <div class="summary-item">
                        <div class="dot"></div>
                        <div>合同金额：<span class="deleted">¥80,000.00</span> → <span class="added">¥95,000.00</span></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="summary-item">
                        <div class="dot"></div>
                        <div>新增阶段：<span class="added">阶段三 - 新增点位安装</span></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="summary-item">
                        <div class="dot"></div>
                        <div>新增任务：<span class="added">新增点位布线、新增点位验收</span></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="summary-item">
                        <div class="dot"></div>
                        <div>修改任务：穿线（修改执行标准）</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="change-highlight-banner" id="changeHighlightBanner" style="display: none;">
                <div class="banner-title">
                    <span>🔄</span>
                    <span>变更提示</span>
                </div>
                <div class="banner-desc">
                    以下内容为变更后的最新内容，变更部分已高亮标识。请仔细核对变更内容后确认。
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="status-flow-card" id="statusFlowCard">
                <div class="status-flow-title">
                    <span>合同状态流程</span>
                </div>
                <div class="status-flow-diagram">
                    <div class="status-flow-step current">
                        <div class="step-circle">📝</div>
                        <div class="step-label">拟定中</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="status-flow-line"></div>
                    <div class="status-flow-step">
                        <div class="step-circle"></div>
                        <div class="step-label">平台审核</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="status-flow-line"></div>
                    <div class="status-flow-step">
                        <div class="step-circle"></div>
                        <div class="step-label">确认中</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="status-flow-line"></div>
                    <div class="status-flow-step">
                        <div class="step-circle"></div>
                        <div class="step-label">已确认</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="status-flow-line"></div>
                    <div class="status-flow-step">
                        <div class="step-circle"></div>
                        <div class="step-label">已签约</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 工人合同：邀请名单 / 自动入架构（默认隐藏，仅方案 B 工人合同显示） -->
            <div class="card worker-invite-card" id="invitationCard" style="display: none;">
                <div class="card-title">
                    <span>🤝 合同邀约与乙方</span>
                </div>
                <div class="worker-contract-meta" id="workerContractMeta"></div>
                <div class="invite-list" id="inviteListBox"></div>
                <div class="arch-note" id="workerArchNote" style="display: none;"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="pc-edit-guide" id="pcEditGuide" style="display: none;">
                <div class="guide-header">
                    <div class="guide-icon">💻</div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="guide-title">推荐使用电脑端编辑</div>
                        <div class="guide-subtitle">合同内容较多，电脑端编辑体验更佳</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="guide-content">
                    合同内容包含多个条款和附件，建议在电脑端进行编辑，操作更便捷、效率更高。
                </div>
                <div class="guide-steps">
                    <div class="step-item">
                        <div class="step-num">1</div>
                        <div class="step-text">在电脑浏览器打开平台官网</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="step-item">
                        <div class="step-num">2</div>
                        <div class="step-text">使用手机扫码授权登录</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="step-item">
                        <div class="step-num">3</div>
                        <div class="step-text">进入合同管理进行编辑</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="guide-actions">
                    <div class="guide-btn primary" onclick="copyEditLink()">
                        <span>🔗</span>
                        <span>复制链接到电脑端编辑</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 拟定中状态编辑表单 -->
            <div class="draft-edit-form" id="draftEditForm" style="display: none;">
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-title">
                        <span>📋 合同基本信息</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label class="form-label">合同类型</label>
                        <div class="readonly-field">
                            <span class="readonly-value" id="editContractType">分包合同</span>
                            <span class="readonly-tag">不可编辑</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label class="form-label">合同编号</label>
                        <div class="readonly-field">
                            <span class="readonly-value" id="editContractNo">HT-2024-001234</span>
                            <span class="readonly-tag">系统生成</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label class="form-label"><span class="required">*</span> 合同名称</label>
                        <input type="text" class="form-input" id="editContractName" placeholder="请输入合同名称" value="水电分包合同">
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label class="form-label"><span class="required">*</span> 合同金额</label>
                        <div class="amount-input-wrap">
                            <span class="currency">¥</span>
                            <input type="number" class="form-input amount-input" id="editContractAmount" placeholder="0.00" value="80000">
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-title">
                        <span>👥 签约双方</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label class="form-label">甲方（发包方）</label>
                        <select class="form-select" id="editPartyA">
                            <option value="">请选择甲方</option>
                            <option value="zhangsan" selected>张三（业主）</option>
                            <option value="owner_rep">李四（业主代表）</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label class="form-label">乙方（承包方）</label>
                        <select class="form-select" id="editPartyB">
                            <option value="">请选择乙方</option>
                            <option value="lisi" selected>李四（水电组长）</option>
                            <option value="wangwu">王五（强电组长）</option>
                            <option value="sunba">孙八（弱电组长）</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="card contract-content-card">
                    <div class="card-title">
                        <span>📄 合同内容</span>
                        <span class="more" id="draftTemplateBtn" onclick="showDraftTemplatePicker()">📄 更换模板</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="content-tabs">
                        <div class="content-tab active" onclick="switchDraftContentTab(this, 'contract-text')">合同正文</div>
                        <div class="content-tab" onclick="switchDraftContentTab(this, 'stage-task')">阶段任务</div>
                        <div class="content-tab" onclick="switchDraftContentTab(this, 'attachment')">附件</div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <!-- 合同正文Tab内容 -->
                    <div class="content-tab-pane active" id="contract-text">
                        <div class="template-info" id="contractTemplateInfo" style="display: none;">
                            <div class="template-tag">已选择模板：标准水电服务合同</div>
                            <div class="template-hint">模板内容不可编辑，如需修改请重新选择模板</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <div class="form-label-row">
                                <label class="form-label">合同正文</label>
                                <span class="view-full-link" onclick="showFullText()">查看全文 ></span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="contract-text-preview" id="contractTextPreview">
                                <p>根据《中华人民共和国民法典》及相关法律法规的规定，甲乙双方本着平等、自愿、公平、诚实信用的原则，就水电工程分包事宜协商一致，订立本合同。</p>
                                <p class="text-title">一、工程概况</p>
                                <p>工程名称：XX小区整体装修水电工程</p>
                                <p>工程地点：XX市XX区XX路XX号</p>
                                <p>工程内容：强电、弱电、给排水等水电工程...</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label class="form-label">补充条款</label>
                            <textarea class="form-textarea" id="editContractExtra" rows="3" placeholder="可输入补充条款内容"></textarea>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <!-- 阶段任务Tab内容 -->
                    <div class="content-tab-pane" id="draft-stage-task">
                        <div class="template-info" id="stageTemplateInfo" style="display: none;">
                            <div class="template-tag">已选择模板：水电工程标准阶段</div>
                            <div class="template-hint">模板内容可编辑调整</div>
                        </div>
                        <div id="editStageList">
                            <div class="stage-card">
                                <div class="stage-card-header">
                                    <div class="stage-card-header-row">
                                        <input type="text" class="stage-name-input" value="材料进场阶段" placeholder="请输入阶段名称">
                                        <div class="stage-sequential">
                                            <span>按序执行</span>
                                            <div class="switch" onclick="toggleStageSequential(this)"></div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="stage-card-header-row">
                                        <div class="stage-actions">
                                            <div class="stage-action-btn add" onclick="addTaskToStage(this)">+ 添加任务</div>
